    "product": {
        "id": 2839,
        "name": "Knitted Bag with Three-Doll Applique",
        "slug": "knit-handbag-with-dolls-applique",
        "status": "publish",
        "type": "variable",
        "modified_gmt": "2026-11-11 09:09:58",
        "long_description_raw": "All BHcrafts products meet fair trade standards so we are proud to be guarantee Fair Trade Organization <a href=\"https://www.bhcrafts.org/pdf/WFTO_Certificate_2014-16.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WFTO certificate</a>\r\n\r\nMore details about our Fair Trade mission you may find at: <a href=\"https://www.bhcrafts.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">www.bhcrafts.org</a>\r\n\r\nGift wrapping in eco friendly recycled paper and postcard with customized text is free of charge with any purchase.\r\n\r\nHere you do not only buy you do \"Shopping With Purpose\"\r\n\r\n<strong>MORE INFORMATION ABOUT ARTISANS</strong>\r\n<img style=\"margin: 5px 10px 0px 0px; max-width: 120px;\" src=\"https://stg-bhcraftsshop-affiliate.kinsta.cloud/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/artisan-handmade-tag.jpg\" alt=\"Tag\" align=\"left\" /> &lt;style=\"padding-left: 120px\"&gt; Lady whose name is written on the hang tag, made this product for you. Her knowledge, patience and love are knit into this product, which makes it unique and customs made. Helping one of hundreds of BHcrafts women producers to earn a living is added value to unique design and the best quality handmade product.\r\nAlthough all our products are made from the best quality materials we cannot guarantee they will not break unless you follow the care instructions. If you do, you will enjoy in this unique piece for a long time.",
        "short_description_raw": "This unique handmade bag with its doll applique can be your ideal everyday bag. Made from 100% cotton, it is sure to withstand the daily stress of a busy lifestyle, and with its width of 29cm (11.4 inch) and a height of 46cm (18.1 inch), it can pack everything you may need for the day, including a laptop.",
        "raw_content_sha256": "c7a8efa1ef577439f39e5daeb365eade1a97c729017ca94db841ad7bf0c808b6",
